TASK:
Generate a UNIQUE email subject line that:
1. Is DISTINCT from the report title (don't copy it)
2. Highlights the most critical or urgent finding
3. Is concise (max 80 characters, ideally 50-70)
4. Is action-oriented or attention-grabbing
5. Suitable for email inbox scanning

EXAMPLES OF GOOD EMAIL SUBJECTS:
- "🚨 Urgent: App Crashes Affecting 24 Users"
- "Performance Issues Surge 25% This Period"
- "User Feedback: Fees & UI Need Immediate Attention"
